.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt ASN1_ITEM_LOOKUP 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ASN1_ITEM_lookup ,
.Nm ASN1_ITEM_get
.Nd lookup ASN.1 structures
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/asn1.h
.Ft const ASN1_ITEM *
.Fo ASN1_ITEM_lookup
.Fa "const char *name"
.Fc
.Ft const ASN1_ITEM *
.Fo ASN1_ITEM_get
.Fa "size_t i"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn ASN1_ITEM_lookup
returns the
.Sy ASN1_ITEM
named
.Fa name .
.Pp
.Fn ASN1_ITEM_get
returns the
.Sy ASN1_ITEM
with index
.Fa i .
This function returns NULL if the index
.Fa i
is out of range.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn ASN1_ITEM_lookup
and
.Fn ASN1_ITEM_get
return a valid
.Sy ASN1_ITEM
structure or NULL if an error occurred.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ERR_get_error 3
